      "description": "Developing a Node.js web application with Typescript to orchestrate simulation training\n○ Designed relational database schema to store user profile information in SQLite\n○ Implemented single sign-on using OAuth2.0 and OpenID Connect protocols\n○ Wrote a service to launch AWS EC2 instance automatically and redirect user to instance so users can train on thin-clients\n○ Developed dashboards to display information pulled from several different registries for different user roles using ReactJS\n○ Utilized Kafka to record data generated by simulators to PostgreSQL database\n○ Built RESTful API to communicate with web client using Express\n○ Worked with WebSocket API to send files and\n○ Deployed microservices via Kubernetes and built images using Docker\n○ Used Helm Charts to manage and deploy Kubernetes pods\n○ Used Playwright to write end-to-end tests\n● Attended to production bugs and improvements in existing Java web application using Scrum methodology to organize and prioritize work\n○ Created RESTful API to facilitate communication between application and external API",
